      "id": "claim_7abacd073d774d4fb050b45f48bcb1f4",
      "statement": "sdp-compact exports exactly six functions: compact and decompact operate on RTCSessionDescriptionInit (compact returns a type-prefixed string, decompact returns a reconstructed RTCSessionDescriptionInit), while compactSDP/decompactSDP/compactSDPBytes/decompactSDPBytes operate on raw SDP strings or bytes and require an explicit isOffer boolean on the decompact side because a bare SDP string does not carry its type.",
